@host=http://localhost:8080
@accessToken=replace-with-access-token
@versionId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@fileId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Public approved versions; with owner/admin token also shows pending and rejected
GET {{host}}/api/v1/mods/example-mod/versions?page=0&size=20

### Moderate version (admin token required)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/mods/example-mod/versions/{{versionId}}?status=APPROVED
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Download approved file
GET {{host}}/api/v1/files/{{fileId}}/download

### Delete version (owner or admin token required)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/mods/example-mod/versions/{{versionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
